sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Controller
  participant L as Workload group
  participant W as Inspection worker
  participant D as Resource teardown
  C->>L: TERM, group deadline scope
  Note over C,L: T = TERM start + grace, at most 2 seconds
  L-->>C: Leader exit notification (no reap)
  C->>W: Pre-escalation snapshot, deadline T
  Note over W: Helper creation or wait stalls
  C->>L: At T: KILL without waiting for snapshot
  Note over C,W: Old epoch invalid, missing snapshot remains failure
  Note over C,L: K = capped phase start + kill/reap allowance, at most 2 seconds
  C->>W: Disable worker, bounded worker cleanup starts
  C->>C: At K minus R: close target signal authority
  C->>L: Nonblocking leader reap attempts, only through K
  C->>D: Continue cleanup and disposal
  W-->>C: Late result (if any)
  C->>C: Retain as rejected, never change failed verdict
  Note over C,D: Worker cleanup runs concurrently, no extra target allowance
